                <pb facs="0554" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg480"/>

                <head>No. 15.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.–<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-07">February 7, 1865</date>—5 p. m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">United States Chargé d’Affaires, Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>Stonewall provisionally under detention. Mercier is without instructions. Seek
                    Mr. Drouyn de Lhuys. I can detain the corsair until instructions arrive. Your
                    despatch and letter received. Thanks.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
